  "description": "Click here and download the Cute Summer Food Sticker Bundle graphic · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "Dive into summer with this adorable Cute Summer Food Sticker Bundle featuring 30 unique designs on a Transparent background. Each high-resolution PNG sticker is perfect for planners, scrapbooking, digital journals, Cricut crafts, printable art, and more!\n\nInside this bundle, you’ll find super cute and trendy summer foods like ice creams, watermelon, lemonade, popsicles, boba tea, tropical fruits, and more – all with charming kawaii faces and a delightful pastel color style. These stickers come with a clean white outline and are ready to use in both digital and printable projects.\n\nWhat’s Included:\n\n30 high-quality PNG files (transparent background)\n\nSize: 300 DPI, perfect for printing\n\nIdeal for sticker printing, journals, crafts & sublimation\n\nPerfect for:\n\nKawaii lovers & sticker collectors\n\nBullet journals & planners\n\nKids crafts & party printables\n\nSmall business packaging or labeling\n\nDIY summer decor and gifts\n\nBoost your designs with this must-have collection of cute summer food stickers that are both fun and functional. Download, print, and start creating today!",
